Short:        Example of gadget programming
Author:       amigansoftware@altavista.com (James Jacobs)
Uploader:     amigansoftware altavista com (James Jacobs)
Type:         dev/src
Version:      1.0
Requires:     OS2.04+
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This comprises three equivalent examples, illustrating straightforward
gadget programming using OS1.x-style gadgets, GadTools, and ReAction,
respectively. They are written in SAS/C 6.58.
